# Performance Optimization Rules

- Remove unused variables, imports, and components.
- Remove `console.log`, `debugger`, and commented-out code from `src/`.
- Do not add duplicate API calls. Debounce search/filter requests.
- Use computed properties for derived data. Avoid expensive work in templates.
- Use `v-if` for heavy conditional UI and `v-show` for frequent toggles.
- Keep grid paging on. Do not load unbounded row sets into `vxceedGrid`.
- Remove event listeners, timers, and subscriptions on destroy.
